 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Old Folded map and Tear-off map pad merged (pad as t). National survey series became archetypes (OS 1:25k/1:50k, IGN 1:25k and TOP 100, Michelin 1:200k, USGS quad, Harvey, Nordeca); Fjällkartan kept as model only (no fetchable page confirmed it; maker pages blocked). Atlases: Times Atlas, National Geographic, Philip's Navigator, A–Z as archetypes; AA atlases kept as models. Old Atlas kind had no source; now cites the Times Atlas page. Peters projection wall map moved to t (not a product). Bollmann kept as a model without a brand entry."
